cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use eDieSeL in research, please cite this repository."
type: software
title: "eDieSeL: Machine-code verification and OS resource models in Lean 4"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 library for proving program behavior from exact machine code and
  explicit models of memory, operating-system resources, and concurrency.
  The project develops reusable verification conditions, executable binding,
  and semantic foundations for systems languages and operating systems.
authors:
  - family-names: "Irvinwop"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Irvinwop/eDieSeL"
url: "https://github.com/Irvinwop/eDieSeL"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - binary verification
  - operating systems
  - program semantics
